{"title":"2000 AMC 10 Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Daily_Dose_of_Math\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_10_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Chandra pays an on-line service provider a fixed monthly fee plus an hourly charge for connect time. Her December bill was <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/6/c563af89126f09396aa8e6725508c9c026aa253f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$12.48$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"49\" height=\"14\" />, but in January her bill was <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/9/6e9444614aa8a376ab1868658a7c12f5a5b1fa17.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$17.54$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"50\" height=\"14\" /> because she used twice as much connect time as in December. What is the fixed monthly fee?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/5/a35435f1e3a56bbd853e7634aad93a1b8ba71ae5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\$ 2.53 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ \\$ 5.06 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\$ 6.24 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\$ 7.42 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\$ 8.77$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"513\" height=\"19\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_10_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Chandra spent <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/6/546a4a167d4e7eec8e8a3a891a17246a663d7e63.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$17.54 - \\$12.48 = \\$5.06$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"191\" height=\"17\" /> more in January than December.  Since she used twice as much connect time in January as she did in December, she must have spent <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/b/80b16d2cda6eb595b2bacc0892e50cbfe53478c7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$5.06$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"16\" /> on connect time in December.  Therefore, the flat fee was <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/a/59af8392888d1b608c5e9419cc2e3ba11758ee3f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$12.58 - \\$5.06 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\$7.42}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"228\" height=\"31\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_10_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> be the fixed fee, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> be the amount Chandra spent on connect time in December.  Then:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/d/a1d94f348cfe1ccf0ff6fa6e2a686ff5b9a65ec2.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x+y=12.48\\]\" width=\"106\" height=\"15\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/9/2495140f53260e43f000cb9217c33fcb328ef3a4.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x+2y=17.54\\]\" width=\"116\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>Solving this system of equations yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/1/6c165fa84aa03ff02b9acfb2f855d55606c08471.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x, y) = (7.42, 5.06)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"155\" height=\"20\" />, so the fixed fee is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/9/0e98f00ce4dbb69bec3c3fa9cb8fb707bf46b29a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\$7.42}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"90\" height=\"31\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Daily_Dose_of_Math\">Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_10_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/9fpwHHTh23I?si=RZHpwnmRleepF_ld\">https://youtu.be/9fpwHHTh23I?si=RZHpwnmRleepF_ld</a>\n</p><p>~Thesmartgreekmathdude\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_10_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_10\" title=\"2000 AMC 10\">2000 AMC 10</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_10_Problems\" title=\"2000 AMC 10 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_10_Answer_Key\" title=\"2000 AMC 10 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_10_Problems/Problem_3\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2000 AMC 10 Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_10_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2000 AMC 10 Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_10_Problems/Problem_1\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2000 AMC 10 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_10_Problems/Problem_2\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2000 AMC 10 Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_10_Problems/Problem_3\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2000 AMC 10 Problems/Problem